        "line": 26,
        "text": "def speedCutoff (δ v : ℝ) : ℝ := 1 - Real.smoothTransition ((v - lowSpeed δ) / (δ / 8))  -- the paper's ζ_L, with lowSpeed δ = 2 + δ/8 (line 22) and highSpeed δ = 2 + δ/4 (line 23)"
